t as he did on his mother 's . [ 22 ] I had been to his hometown . I knew from whence he sprang . He taught himself grammar . He taught himself manners . If anybody\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [], \"prior_explanation\": \"I am uncertain about the specific profession of 'C. Mayer' as this name is common and lacks sufficient context to identify a unique individual.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.\", \"answer\": \"German operatic mezzo-soprano\", \"quote\": \"Christa Mayer Christa Mayer is a German operatic mezzo-soprano.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player.\", \"answer\": \"professional basketball player\", \"quote\": \"Christa Mayer is a German professional basketball player.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0164-72a2545a111f:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"C. Mayer\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Constant Mayer was a French painter who emigrated to the United States.\", \"answer\": \"French painter\", \"quote\": \"Constant Mayer Constant Mayer (October 3, 1829 – May 12, 1911) was a French painter who emigrated to the United States.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}]}"
